Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Interactive Exploration", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"7840dd9a-0df5-0444-a06c-a6eca71cf2b3"],

Cell["\<\
Lab 3A explores two-spin transfer efficiency as J-coupling, chemical-shift \
offsets, duration T, and target objective vary. Lab 3B explores dissipative \
efficiency vs relaxation rate gamma in Liouville space. Click each queued \
button to re-optimise.\
