       RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", "\n", "      ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Relaxation rate R=1/T1=1/T2 (s^-1)\>\"", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Slider", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", "rate", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "8.", ",", " ", "0.25"}], "}"}]}], 
                 "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\< \>\"", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", "rate", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
            "}"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"\"\<Pulse Duration (ms)\>\"", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Row", "[", 
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"Slider", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", "durMs", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                  RowBox[{"{", 
                   RowBox[{"5.", ",", " ", "40.", ",", " ", "1."}], "}"}]}], 
                 "]"}], ",", " ", "\"\< \>\"", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", "durMs", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], 
            "}"}]}], "\n", "    ", "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
       "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Button", "[", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<Optimise Open-System Liouville\>\"", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"data", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"runLab3B", "[", 
           RowBox[{"rate", ",", " ", "durMs"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Method", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Queued\>\""}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"Dynamic", "[", 
        RowBox[{"renderLab3B", "[", "data", "]"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "  ", "}"}],
      "]"}], "]"}]}], "\n", "]"}]], "Input",ExpressionUUID->"1d65e680-2dcf-\
b246-ba45-d0e083a4f85a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Suggested Experiments", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0fedee24-e2fe-4e43-a180-4b7f9ea335e9"],

Cell["\<\
1. Coupling timescale 1/J: Set J = 140 Hz in Lab 3A (full transfer time ~ 7.1 \
ms for I1z -> I2z vs ~ 3.6 ms for INEPT I1x -> 2 I1y I2z). Lower Duration T \
to 4 ms and see which objective breaks first.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"e2b7ea86-2344-0b4b-a870-e526804d8933"],

Cell["\<\
2. Universal Gate Cost: Compare I1z -> I2z vs CNOT Gate at T = 5 ms: why does \
CNOT require longer evolution or stronger J?\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"061a8042-a3a5-be42-9992-acd02ad52691"],

Cell["\<\
3. Relaxation-Time Trade-off: In Lab 3B with R = 5.0 s^-1 (T1 = T2 = 0.2 s), \
test T = 5 ms versus T = 40 ms: fast pulses limit relaxation loss, whereas \
overly short pulses run up against RF bandwidth or amplitude requirements.\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"24b33ddf-ec72-8940-808a-c427d1588a4d"],

Cell["\<\
4. In the Worked Example, change TargetNormalization -> \"Frobenius\" on the \
INEPT observable (note ||I1x||_F != ||2 I1y I2z||_F? Actually here they share \
Frobenius norm; try Iz -> I1z I2z vs TransformationAmplitude to see the \
difference!).\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"6705c24e-07af-464a-b9ff-ae932db07739"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Summary", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5510937e-0ea1-8345-8bbd-674a640b71ec"],

Cell["\<\
We optimised heteronuclear polarisation transfer, antiphase INEPT creation, \
non-Hermitian coherence-order conversion, and open-system Liouville \
relaxation transfers. TargetNormalization -> \"TargetNorm\" matches \
SpinDynamica's TransformationAmplitude identically, while Liouville \
propagation accurately models irreversible relaxation inside GRAPE.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c807d908-8f0e-c548-baa4-42bb4639695f"],

